  "name": "BEN_ELIG_TO_PRTE_RSN_F",
  "type": "TABLE",
  "description": "BEN_ELIG_TO_PRTE_RSN_F identifies the impact of a life event reason on eligibility for a program, plan type in program,plan in program, plan, or option in plan.  A life event reason may be identified as causing immediate eligibility or ineligibility without checking any applicable eligibility profiles.  Examples of life events that may make a person immediately ineligible are termination of employment and death.",
